<Base title="Protecting the source. Sustaining the future. | Watercana"><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Our environmental mission</div><h1>Protecting the source. Sustaining the future.</h1><p>Conservation with every sip.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="lead">Natural springs depend on healthy ecosystems. We seek to minimize disturbance around water sources, encourage indigenous tree cover and raise awareness about protecting recharge zones.</p><p class="lead">Watercana commits 20% of net profits to conservation and community sensitization. As the business develops, we intend to share updates and evidence of our activities through our journal.</p><p class="lead">Our priorities include spring protection, reforestation and practical engagement with neighboring communities.</p><a class="btn dark" href="/contact/">Connect with us</a></div><img src="/images/spring-landscape.svg" alt="Illustration of a spring landscape"/></div></section><section class="cta"><div class="wrap"><h2>Follow our conservation journey</h2><p>Updates and stories from Watercana.</p><a class="btn" href="/journal/">Read the journal</a></div></section></Base>